{"version":"1.0","encoding":"UTF-8","entry":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-5458714924543001380.post-7739796778428363871"},"published":{"$t":"2025-12-11T11:14:00.001-10:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2025-12-11T12:54:43.348-10:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Army"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"cybersecurity"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"DoD"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Hawaiian Electric"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"HECO"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"HEI"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Navy"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Hawaiian Electric \u0026 The Military"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh70iTM8C7WfaSo5BfvNYZjXeT3RRhKVqXLRHHlsK9r20KLkVoyszxB7ScJSZl6ZL7Qo2sbH6mIpFncUrnlRfjyAA96T-AnKN0MbVVyKFXWGsBJSOl2Ihfkg4OnRRw268VenPYl-88JXLGpZ5DPX7nEobwgrDxP3Mt_NpR3edY7mdJ5ADI_FZvHAQYEuXge\/s2560\/Pearl%20Harbor%202012-07-31%2015.12.44.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003E\u003Cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1920\" data-original-width=\"2560\" height=\"362\" src=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh70iTM8C7WfaSo5BfvNYZjXeT3RRhKVqXLRHHlsK9r20KLkVoyszxB7ScJSZl6ZL7Qo2sbH6mIpFncUrnlRfjyAA96T-AnKN0MbVVyKFXWGsBJSOl2Ihfkg4OnRRw268VenPYl-88JXLGpZ5DPX7nEobwgrDxP3Mt_NpR3edY7mdJ5ADI_FZvHAQYEuXge\/w482-h362\/Pearl%20Harbor%202012-07-31%2015.12.44.jpg\" width=\"482\" \/\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003EPearl Harbor. Posted on December 11, 2025 by Henry Curtis\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Cspan face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHawaiian Electric Industries (HEI) and the\u0026nbsp;Hawaiian Electric Companies\n(HECO) have many links to the military.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003ETwo retired 4-star Navy admirals who commanded the U.S.\nPacific Fleet and Pacific Command\/Indo-Pacific Command play a role in managing\nHawaiian Electric. Admiral Thomas B. Fargo has served on the HEI board since\n2005 and as Chair since 2020. Admiral John Aquilino was appointed to Hawaiian\nElectric board in August 2025.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe Department of the Navy, on behalf of the Department of\nDefense, intervened in Public Utilities Commission dockets addressing Kauai\nIsland Utility Cooperates acquisition of the Kauai grid, the proposed NextEra\nacquisition of the Hawaiian Electric Companies, and KIUC and HECO rate cases.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe Marine Corps Base Hawaii on Mokapu Peninsula near\nKaneohe, Oahu was named as a potential landing site for the proposed Big Wind\nproject that would have powered Oahu with wind turbines on Lana`i and Moloka`i,\nand for the proposed Aukahi Energy Floating Offshore Wind project sponsored by\nProgression Energy and EDF Renewables North America.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003ETwo recent Public Utilities Commission dockets involved\nHECO and the military. HECO`s acquisition of the U.S. Army`s Oahu Electric\nDistribution Systems in 2019-20, docket no. 2019-0349; and HECO contract with\nthe Defense Information Systems Agency for leasing dark fiber in 2021-23,\ndocket no.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;2021-0186.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cu\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EArmy Privatization Project\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/u\u003E\u003C\/b\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe Army has been privatizing its utility systems on bases\nnationwide pursuant to federal\u0026nbsp;legislation designed to help the military\nfocus on its core mission of national defense. HECO won a competitive bid for a\n50-year contract to provide the electrical distribution system for the U.S.\nArmy Garrison-Hawaii (USAG-HI).\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe 12 installations on Oahu are: Schofield Barracks - Main\nPost, Wheeler Arm¥ Airfield, Schofield Barracks - East Range, Pililaau Arm¥\nRecreation Center, Fort Shafter, Tripler Arm¥ Medical Center, Fort DeRussy,\nHelemano Military Reservation, Kahuku Training: Area, Dillineham Military\nReservation, Aliamanu Military Reservation, and Makua Valley Training Area.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EAs of 2015, USAG-HI supported nearly 100,000 former and\ncurrent soldiers, civilians and family members Statewide.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO agreed to acquire Army Distribution Systems for a\npurchase price of $16,298,000. HECO will also make investments totaling\napproximately $24.4 million over the first five years of the Contract to\ncorrect existing system deficiencies.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EOver the 50-year term of the Contract, HECO estimated that\nit will invest an additional $213 million for renewals and replacements of the\nunderlying assets. HECO affirms that these expenditures will be reimbursed by\nthe Army over time through fees paid under the Contract.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe Commission approved the contract. HECO seeks to commit\nan estimated $237.4 million in capital costs for the Army Privatization\nProject. HECO shall not be permitted to recover any costs associated with\npre-existing environmental conditions from other ratepayers. HECO shall not be\npermitted to recover costs from general ratepayers that are deemed\nunrecoverable from the Army.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cu\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EDark Fiber\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/u\u003E\u003C\/b\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO developed its first set of fiber installation\nstandards: standard count fiber for all-dielectric self-supporting (ADSS)\ninstallation in 2014.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EPrior to 2014, there were no standard cable sizes, but\n60-strand fiber was commonly installed. In the docket HECO asserted that it was\nassessing the need to amend its “\u003Ci\u003Ecurrent guidelines and practices to\nincrease the standard ADSS fiber to 144-strand or 288 strand, given the focus\non broadband equity and access, especially as a result of the COVID-19 pandemic\nand the need for all Hawai'i residents and visitors to have access to\nhigh-speed internet in all parts of our state.”\u003C\/i\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EIt is cheaper to install excessive fiber rather than\nincrementally add new fiber as it is needed. HECO considered leasing its excess\nfiber.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO defined \"dark fiber\" as \u003Ci\u003E\"an unused\nstrand or strands of optical fiber within a unit (bundle) of optical fibers\ninstalled for communication needs.”\u003C\/i\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO`s Information Technology Network Operations Center\n(NOC) was established in 2018 \u003Ci\u003E“to guard against cyber security threats and\nmaintain network availability.”\u003C\/i\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe military wanted use of fiber not associated with public\ncommunication networks. HECO provided middle-mile fiber to provide\ncommunication links between military bases.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO signed a proposed contract and service level agreement\nwith Defense Information Systems Agency (DISA) and filed the application with\nthe Commission requesting authorization to lease existing optical fiber cable\nassets in Honolulu to DISA, a combat support agency within the Department of\nDefense.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO and DISA would both have access to the physical\ndemarcation points at each end of the leased fiber route. Neither entity would\nbe allowed access to the other entities network.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EDISA will install its fiber optic infrastructure on its\nside of any on its side of any demarcation points, and then HECO will conduct\ntests to \"ensure fiber quality and that the entire fiber route is\noperational.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe contract was federally labeled as \"\u003Ci\u003EControlled\nUnclassified Information\u003C\/i\u003E\" (CUI). This is perhaps the only Commission\nproceeding where key documents were classified at the highest of the seven\nlevels of access to documents: (1) no one, (2) only the Commission, (3)\nCommission and Consumer Advocate, (4) Commission and Consumer Advocate and\nnon-competitors to the applicant, (5) all parties, (6) everyone although the\ninformation is very hard to find, and (7) easily accessible by everyone.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EThe Commission approved the contract.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Ci\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E“As a preliminary matter, the Commission finds that this\ndocket has a unique posture due to the sensitive nature of the information\ninvolved. DISA's status as a combat support agency under the DOD means that\nprotection of its CUI is a matter of national security, and the Commission\nacknowledges that disclosure of CUI -- even to the Commission-- could hinder\nnational security national security, and potentially breach certain federal\nregulations.”\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/i\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003EHECO shall file an annual status report that includes\nwhether \u003Ci\u003E“HECO's cybersecurity efforts and expenses increased as a direct\nresult of this arrangement and. if so, what is the associated increase in costs\nand whether the military payments offset any such any increases.”\u003C\/i\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: black; font-family: \u0026quot;Calibri\u0026quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\"\u003E#\u0026nbsp;\n\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; #\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; #\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http:\/\/www.ililani.media\/feeds\/7739796778428363871\/comments\/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http:\/\/www.ililani.media\/2025\/12\/hawaiian-electric-military.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/5458714924543001380\/posts\/default\/7739796778428363871"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/5458714924543001380\/posts\/default\/7739796778428363871"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http:\/\/www.ililani.media\/2025\/12\/hawaiian-electric-military.html","title":"Hawaiian Electric \u0026 The Military"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Ililani Media"},"uri":{"$t":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/profile\/13958886234963893640"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https:\/\/img1.blogblog.com\/img\/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh70iTM8C7WfaSo5BfvNYZjXeT3RRhKVqXLRHHlsK9r20KLkVoyszxB7ScJSZl6ZL7Qo2sbH6mIpFncUrnlRfjyAA96T-AnKN0MbVVyKFXWGsBJSOl2Ihfkg4OnRRw268VenPYl-88JXLGpZ5DPX7nEobwgrDxP3Mt_NpR3edY7mdJ5ADI_FZvHAQYEuXge\/s72-w482-h362-c\/Pearl%20Harbor%202012-07-31%2015.12.44.jpg","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}}